<title>SINGAPORE: Advanced Systems 1996/97 net profit up.</title>
<headline>Advanced Systems 1996/97 net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			 (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    11.65  vs    7.49</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct)			15.0   vs   15.0</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		   12.0   vs    9.0</p>
<p>    Turnover				88.68  vs   81.89</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	0.04  vs    0.01</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		   1.05  vs    1.01</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)	     4.12  vs    3.20</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			17.18  vs   12.46</p>
</text>
